            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/profile",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["profile"]
            },
            "description": "Create profile with structured file uploads. Backend will upload files and store URLs in JSON structure:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"images\": [\n    {\"url\": \"uploaded_face_url\"},\n    {\"url\": \"uploaded_fullbody_url\"},\n    {\"url\": \"uploaded_smile_url\"},\n    {\"url\": \"uploaded_extra1_url\"},\n    {\"url\": \"uploaded_extra2_url\"},\n    {\"url\": \"uploaded_extra3_url\"}\n  ],\n  \"imagesJson\": {\n    \"face\": \"uploaded_face_url\",\n    \"fullbody\": \"uploaded_fullbody_url\", \n    \"toothyGrin\": \"uploaded_smile_url\",\n    \"extras\": {\n      \"1\": \"uploaded_extra1_url\",\n      \"2\": \"uploaded_extra2_url\",\n      \"3\": \"uploaded_extra3_url\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```"
          }
